<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-14T12:12:38.522Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:12:38 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Navy, Coast Guard and United States Navy conducted a bilateral maritime cooperative activity in the West Philippine Sea, while the Chinese government warned Taiwan of consequences for using water cannons against a Chinese ship. The Philippine Coast Guard continued to block Chinese water-cannon attacks on its vessels during medical evacuations at Ayungin Shoal and in the Luzon Strait, and repelled Vietnam-flagged fishing boats near Kota Island. ASEAN coast guards are drafting a common legal framework for maritime security, and the United States secured a foreign military sales contract for Coast Guard boats worth up to $12.2 million. 176 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTFBwQThMT280c1VrbXhENkY4SVh0bUpaUUd5elpweGJsZzBwTHlDc3E1WGt4RFd4Rkp3d29KNmhqU3E5em1TOV9hX1FYTFBGMm5aLTBZdTJxUWI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Center for International Maritime Security&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPRm5oS1NhU2o2b0NrWEpuZ0tPTHhpRC03bFNTS1BialJVYmhLMnkzZnB1a1RmLThKaTVzTHZQb01sTHdqX2RVOWZPZjBUSEc0X2pLMGQ5ZmVUX3c1SjNtMmdiSEUzVlNsSDFybUtuYW5WM0tNUWR4aEMxaldJaVhuWWFHN3FfTmlRNGtKYTNUMWV4N0lSR184SHU5TG9EZV9yeFFEM0NuYW9uRUhWUEhwdTZldmtlWE0yOHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Diplomacy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NST Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxOZGlibTBqRjRXSEY1WkJ5TDMwcTVPd0Q5TmNmT0hRWUhTdDFQYmdmcjZudWFVTWlUX0oyeVlobE9oTVhFRlpPZFdmZHE2RElkX3Q3RzdobE1NN1BKckM0OE5Ia0VTT3ltMFNMQWF4Rl9kMGJUWnZGZnE4bUxfNUhZejBIN3BFMkFmQ0tYOXpGRzJGX054LThsYlh2T2d0WVZ3eDg1QV90TG9LeFZQYndaYWFwaHJ